          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f7faf9;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#6d28d9;--accent-600:#5b21b6;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial}\\n    html,body{height:100%}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#0f172a;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:32px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#a78bfa);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}\\n    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;margin-top:26px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)}\\n    .hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;padding:28px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(109,40,217,0.06),rgba(99,102,241,0.02));}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:24px;color:#0f172a}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .svg-hero{width:100%;height:140px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .section{margin-top:18px}\\n    .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}\\n    button.cta{background:var(--accent);border:none;color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\\n    .muted-small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .habit-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\\n    .habit{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed #eef2ff;background:#fff}\\n    .pricing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .price-card{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eef2ff;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdff)}\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">W</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-600);font-weight:600\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <div>\\n        <section class=\\\"card hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"hero-head\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h1 id=\\\"hero-head\\\">A Quiet Call to Rebalance</h1>\\n            <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I'm {{COACH_NAME}} {{CREDENTIALS}} — I guide you through a compassionate, structured path so small daily shifts stack into lasting vitality. Start with one clear step today.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"svg-hero\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"abstract hero motif\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px;background:transparent\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)\\\">Schedule a call</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card section\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"diag-head\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"diag-head\\\">Quick Balance Diagnostic</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\">A three-minute self-check to surface the first pivot. No judgement — just clarity.</p>\\n          <form action=\\\"#\\\" onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();alert('Diagnostic submitted — a gentle follow-up will arrive at {{EMAIL}}')\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"grid-2\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <label for=\\\"energy\\\">Current energy</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"energy\\\" name=\\\"energy\\\">\\n                  <option>Low — tired most days</option>\\n                  <option>Fluctuating — highs and troughs</option>\\n                  <option>Consistent — I feel steady</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <label for=\\\"stress\\\">Stress level</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"stress\\\" name=\\\"stress\\\">\\n                  <option>High</option>\\n                  <option>Manageable</option>\\n                  <option>Low</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"habit\\\">A habit you wish you had</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"habit\\\" name=\\\"habit\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g., sleep by 11pm, daily walk\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get my result</button>\\n              <span class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Results land to <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong>.</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card section\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"plan-head\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"plan-head\\\">My 3-Phase Alignment Plan</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\">A clinical, compassionate framework that meets you where you are and builds toward sustained ease.</p>\\n          <ol style=\\\"margin-top:12px;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li><strong>Stabilize</strong> — gentle structure and baseline habits for immediate relief.</li>\\n            <li><strong>Strengthen</strong> — targeted practices to increase capacity and resilience.</li>\\n            <li><strong>Integrate</strong> — systems to sustain gains while living your life fully.</li>\\n          </ol>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">This pathway is delivered through small weekly lessons, peer-supported cohorts, and actionable micro-habits you can use each day.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card section\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"micro-head\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"micro-head\\\">Tiny Habits, Deep Shift</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\">It isn't about willpower. It's about designing rituals that work with your life.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"habit-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"habit\\\"><div><strong>2-minute breath reset</strong><div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Morning or mid-day</div></div><div><button class=\\\"cta\\\" onclick=\\\"alert('Marked: 2-minute breath reset')\\\">Start</button></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"habit\\\"><div><strong>Evening wind-down</strong><div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Screen-off 30 mins before bed</div></div><div><button class=\\\"cta\\\" onclick=\\\"alert('Marked: Evening wind-down')\\\">Start</button></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"habit\\\"><div><strong>1 walk, 10 mins</strong><div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Micro-movement to reset focus</div></div><div><button class=\\\"cta\\\" onclick=\\\"alert('Marked: 1 walk, 10 mins')\\\">Start</button></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card section\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"pricing-head\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"pricing-head\\\">Membership Frame: Cohort Paths</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\">I run seasonal cohort groups where learning, accountability, and community accelerate change. Pick the right doorway for your season.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"pricing-grid\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Seed Cohort</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">For those beginning a steady routine</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\\\">$299</div>\\n              <ul style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);padding-left:16px\\\">\\n                <li>6 weeks, weekly group sessions</li>\\n                <li>Daily micro-practices</li>\\n                <li>Community channel</li>\\n              </ul>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Build Cohort</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">For steady growth and accountability</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\\\">$749</div>\\n              <ul style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);padding-left:16px\\\">\\n                <li>12 weeks, peer cohort + guest sessions</li>\\n                <li>Weekly small-group coaching</li>\\n                <li>Personal habit prescriptions</li>\\n              </ul>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Anchor Cohort</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">For sustained identity-level change</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700\\\">$1499</div>\\n              <ul style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);padding-left:16px\\\">\\n                <li>24 weeks, limited cohort size</li>\\n                <li>Direct coaching access + frameworks</li>\\n                <li>Integration playbook</li>\\n              </ul>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Explore cohorts</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)\\\">See details</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card section\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-head\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"faq-head\\\">A few practical notes</h2>\\n          <dl style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <dt style=\\\"font-weight:600\\\">Do you offer sliding scale?</dt>\\n            <dd style=\\\"margin:6px 0\\\">Yes — limited sliding options are available for Seed Cohort. We prioritize access while honoring the program's design.</dd>\\n            <dt style=\\\"font-weight:600\\\">Is this a substitute for medical care?</dt>\\n            <dd style=\\\"margin:6px 0\\\">No — coaching supports behavior and wellbeing goals and is not medical treatment. If you have health concerns, please consult your healthcare provider.</dd>\\n          </dl>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Contact & Booking</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Reach out directly, or request a focused 20-minute discovery.</p>\\n          <form action=\\\"#\\\" onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();alert('Thanks — we received your message. We will follow up at {{EMAIL}} or {{PHONE}}')\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" required />\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required />\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Message</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"A brief note about what you'd like support with\\\"></textarea>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send message</button>\\n              <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;width:100%\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"avatar\\\" style=\\\"width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover\\\" />\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{COACH_NAME}} {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">I bring a gentle, practical method rooted in evidence-informed frameworks and ceremonies that invite lasting change.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"width:100%;margin-top:6px;display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;text-align:center\\\">Book discovery</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);flex:1;text-align:center\\\">Email</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Patterns & resources</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-small\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Download the orientation packet and a 7-day micro-habit starter to begin today.</p>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);display:inline-block\\\">Get starter pack</a>\\n          <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"pattern\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;margin-top:8px;border-radius:6px\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted-small\\\">© <span id=\\\"year\\\">2026</span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Design: clinic_modern • Program model: cohort • Voice: spiritual teacher</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# wellness_coach-2026-02-16T05-07-24-460Z-035\\n\\nThis bundle chunk includes the Contact page and a README for the wellness coach site built with the clinic_modern layout and a spiritual_teacher voice.\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — Full contact page with condensed versions of required site sections so those elements ripple outside the index: hero, diagnostic, plan, micro_habits, pricing, and cta. The page is intentionally modular so it can be used as a landing/contact hub.\\n\\nPlaceholders used (replace these server-side or during build):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{COACH_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout family: clinic_modern — crisp grid, calm palette, clinical-but-warm components.\\n- Voice family: spiritual_teacher — compassionate, slightly ceremonial wording without medical claims.\\n- Program model: cohort — pricing and offerings framed as seasonal cohorts and membership paths.\\n\\nAssets referenced (add to project root before deployment):\\n- assets/img/hero.svg — unique hero motif (used in hero section)\\n- assets/img/avatar.svg — local avatar image\\n- assets/img/pattern.svg — decorative pattern used in the sidebar\\n\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\n- Form submissions in contact.html currently use inline JS alerts for demonstration; wire them to your backend endpoints or form service.\\n- No external fonts, CDNs, or analytics are included in this chunk per spec.\\n\\nDeveloper tips:\\n- Maintain unique headings and nav labels across pages to satisfy uniqueness requirements.\\n- Ensure the SVG asset files are unique and stored at the paths above.\\n- Keep the replacement of placeholders consistent during build or templating.\\n\\nIf you need additional pages (index, about, programs, pricing, testimonials, book, services) or the SVG assets, request the next chunk and they will be generated with matching design language and unique content.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
